# Real source-only context generator, mocked provider, injected completed queue.
name: Review generated context as an exact durable Map without extra work
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 context-draft | completed-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | result-review
expect: m Review Map
ask: Does the completed context result offer inspection and Map review while disclosing allowance and preserving explicit operator choice?
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 m Review Map | result-80
ask: Is generated-context review clear and keyboard reachable at 80x24?
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 m Review Map | result-60
ask: Does 60x20 retain readable result guidance and visible controls?
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 m Map | result-40
expect: Enter inspect
ask: Does 40x12 keep Map review, exact inspection and back available without clipped actions?
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 m Review Map | result-tall
ask: Does the tall result keep a clear hierarchy without losing the job result or controls?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 m Review Map | result-wide
ask: Does the wide result disclose the bounded plan and allowance without suggesting automatic new work?
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 15 m Review Map | result-returned
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | awaiting-acceptance
require-live-snap: 25 Command line application | generated-map
expect-not: Other active context
expect-not: No threat model detected
expect-not: This attempt carried no map evidence
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART reviewing
ask: Does real foreground handoff present the exact generated Map for explicit acceptance while another context remains active?
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 20 Map ✓ | after-acceptance
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
submit: map
require-live-snap: 20 accepted | accepted-map
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | exact-dfd
expect-not: Other active context
ask: Does accepted Map retain the generated DFD and useful navigation without starting discovery?
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 Command line application | map-40
ask: Is generated DFD inspection usable in the smallest supported terminal?
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 15 DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | before-restart
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 Command line application | resumed-map
expect-not: Other active context
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART resumed
ask: Does restart restore accepted generated Map with exact context and truthful no-color output?
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART drift
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 context-draft | historical-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | historical-result
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 earlier source content | refused-handoff
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART refused
ask: Does source drift refuse a fresh Map handoff with useful recovery guidance, retain the recorded context, and avoid automatic regeneration?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | refused-return
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | historical-inspection
expect: Offline generated context
expect-not: Labeled other active context
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART refused
ask: After dismissing the refusal, can the operator inspect the exact historical context without a replacement job or reset of recorded spending?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
